                  <p>Like Mounjaro , there are other GLP- 1 medicines available for weight loss treatment in the UK. See the list of options below:</p>
                  <p>Injectable Medications:</p>
                  <p>Wegovy is considered as one of the best alternatives for Mounjaro. Wegovy contains active ingredient semaglutide which belong to the same category of GLP-1 receptor agonist. Wegovy does have a more well-known counterpart, known as Ozempic. However, Ozempic is only licensed for use for patients with Type 2 Diabetes.</p>
