               <p>Once you stop taking Mounjaro , the appetite is expected to be back to normal gradually. Also, weight regain is possible if you don’t follow healthy diet and involve in regular physical exercises. Remember, Mounjaro is not a medicine you take for life. It is designed to help the user develop a healthier, sustainable lifestyle. Once you come off of this medicine, it is important to stay consistent with diet and exercise. 
